="left"/>design, tasks)<br align="left"/></font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Spec Kit<br align="left"/>(specify, plan,<br align="left"/>tasks)<br align="left"/></font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Antigravity<br align="left"/>implementation plan<br align="left"/></font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Claude Code<br align="left"/>planning<br align="left"/></font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Codex task plan<br align="left"/>(to validate)<br align="left"/></font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F4F8FC" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#1F3864"><b>L3 Governed<br align="left"/>runtime<br align="left"/></b></font></td><td bgcolor="#FFF2CC" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#7F6000">E2A<br align="left"/>+ e2a-managed-providers<br align="left"/></font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Strands Agents<br align="left"/>AgentCore Runtime,<br align="left"/>Gateway, Policy,<br align="left"/>Identity, Memory<br align="left"/></font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Agent Framework<br align="left"/>Foundry Agent Service<br align="left"/>Control Plane<br align="left"/>Entra Agent ID<br align="left"/></font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">ADK<br align="left"/>Agent Platform:<br align="left"/>Runtime, Gateway,<br align="left"/>Identity, Model Armor<br align="left"/></font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Claude Agent SDK<br align="left"/>Managed Agents<br align="left"/></font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Agents SDK<br align="left"/>Agents API<br align="left"/>Guardrails<br align="left"/></font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F4F8FC" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#1F3864"><b>L4 Verification<br align="left"/>and evidence<br align="left"/></b></font></td><td bgcolor="#FFF2CC" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#7F6000">A2C Phase C<br align="left"/>E2A release gate<br align="left"/>observability seam<br align="left"/></font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Kiro hooks,<br align="left"/>property tests<br align="left"/>AgentCore Evaluations<br align="left"/></font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Copilot hooks,<br align="left"/>code review<br align="left"/>Foundry evaluations,<br align="left"/>tracing<br align="left"/></font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Verification artifacts<br align="left"/>Agent Evaluation,<br align="left"/>Simulation<br align="left"/></font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Claude Code hooks<br align="left"/>Outcomes (preview)<br align="left"/></font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Codex runs tests,<br align="left"/>reviews PRs<br align="left"/>SDK tracing<br align="left"/></font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F4F8FC" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#1F3864"><b>L5 Change and<br align="left"/>provenance<br align="left"/></b></font></td><td bgcolor="#FFF2CC" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#7F6000">aidlc-change<br align="left"/>AD-01 trail<br align="left"/></font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Kiro autonomous<br align="left"/>agent (preview)<br align="left"/></font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Copilot coding agent</font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Antigravity agents</font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Claude Code</font></td><td bgcolor="white" align="left" valign="top"><font color="#222222">Codex cloud tasks</font></td></tr></table>>];
